1
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:40,880
A scent of jasmine as I lean down near,

2
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:45,820
And whisper softly: "Good evening, lion" in your ear.

3
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:50,909
Your body stiffens like a pulling bow,

4
00:00:51,369 --> 00:00:55,759
Your knuckles white as tears begin to flow.

5
00:00:56,079 --> 00:01:00,780
I kneel beside your chair to meet your eyes,

6
00:01:01,149 --> 00:01:05,569
And strip away the game and my disguise.

7
00:01:05,819 --> 00:01:10,140
I saw you suffer through those three long days,

8
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:14,870
Lost inside my riddle's heavy maze.

9
00:01:15,579 --> 00:01:19,950
Come meet my mother when tomorrow comes,

10
00:01:20,269 --> 00:01:24,650
And listen to my records while the evening hums.

11
00:01:24,909 --> 00:01:29,480
No dance floor secret, no more mystery,

12
00:01:30,049 --> 00:01:34,400
I take your hand and set your spirit free.

13
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:40,109
I feel relief wash over your pale face,

14
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:44,569
Your warm grip holding me in tight embrace.

15
00:01:44,709 --> 00:01:49,200
Your eyes ignite with such a fragile light,

16
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:54,519
A lion waking in the golden night.

17
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:38,250
I brush your hand and give a subtle wink,

18
00:02:38,370 --> 00:02:43,569
So glad I saved you from the dark abyss's brink.

19
00:02:43,870 --> 00:02:47,889
I walk toward the bar with glowing pride,

20
00:02:48,219 --> 00:02:53,419
So happy that I put my games aside.

21
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:58,379
My red dress sways into the warm retreat,

22
00:02:58,580 --> 00:03:03,020
Two worlds aligned where love and music meet.

23
00:03:03,229 --> 00:03:07,599
I opened up my heart and threw the key,

24
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:12,979
To dance forever with the lion in me.

25
00:03:33,939 --> 00:03:38,319
Tomorrow night the door unlocks,

26
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:42,849
No more secrets, no more clocks.

27
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:47,740
I opened up, I gave the key,

28
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:53,080
My lion's coming home with me.